body:
New create-character screen from the user's wide art: working/classic_ui/hd/create_character_screen.png (1920x1080 RGB; the user's, read-only; archive replaced art to working/archive/). The art is the main menu backdrop with a blank stone tablet at roughly x 970-1590, y 315-910 (by eye; measure before laying out), where the form goes.

User, 2026-11-25: "We will want to use the dialog kit for the input boxes and follow general protocol for that".

Today: screen_create_new_character.cpp lays everything out in 800x600 with CControls (as of 2026-11-25):
- name textbox (272,167);
- gender, skin, hair style, hair colour and underwear toggles (316, 217 + 16n);
- stat toggles (316, y);
- Warrior, Mage and Master buttons (140/225/310, 505);
- Create and Cancel (464/580, 505).

Protocol to follow:
- the backdrop follows the HH-0082 rule: full image when wide, centre 4:3 crop in letterbox; drawn in high resolution and cover-fitted, with control positions derived through the same art-to-UI mapping;
- every input (the name box, toggles, +/- steppers and buttons) uses CControls with panel kit visuals: kit inset fields, kit buttons and kit text recipes, as in the other kit screens (HH-0054..0066);
- the form sits on the tablet; the character preview and class buttons stay usable.

Waits on HH-0082: it adds the cover backdrop and IRenderer::get_screen_extent this screen reuses.

**Done when:** the screen shows the new art with the form on the tablet in kit controls; name entry, every toggle and stat, the class buttons, Create and Cancel work by mouse and keyboard; both aspects look right; both builds are clean; screenshots are attached.

**Correction, 2026-11-25:** the user: "That screen was supposed to be create new account not character - that is my bad". The art is now working/classic_ui/hd/create_new_account.png (1920x1080 RGB, the same tablet). The target is screen_create_account.cpp: four textboxes (Account, Password, Confirm, Email at x 340, y 210/232/254/276 in 800x600), focused-field help text, and Create/Clear/Cancel buttons (y 398), as of 2026-11-25. The create-character text above no longer applies. The rest is unchanged: kit inset fields and kit buttons through CControls, the form on the tablet (UI about 403-742 x 194-489), and the HH-0082 cover-fit backdrop. Mockup: .claude/scratch/coordinator/create_char/account_mockup_zoom.png.

**Layout approved, 2026-11-25:** the user liked the create-account mockup ("I like this") and chose title variant D: the kit serif title in parchment (240,228,204) with a soft dark glow (10,6,4) behind it (5 px dilate, 2.5 px blur, 85% alpha), in place of the kit red, which blended into the stone. The wave flourishes stay as they are. Reference: .claude/scratch/coordinator/create_char/title_variants.py, account_mockup_zoom.png.
